      "name": "Canopy local",
      "role": "Resident",
      "accent": 0
    }
  ],
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "keeper_0",
      "speaker": "maro",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "first",
          "unless": "met_maro"
        },
        {
          "node": "hello"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "first",
          "sets": "met_maro",
          "text": "New face! Name's Maro. I tune suits for the jet-and-grapple crowd. Bring me scrap and parts and I'll make that rig sing.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "What can you do for my suit?",
              "next": "upgrades_intro"
            },
            {
              "text": "Got any armor?",
              "next": "armor"
            },
            {
              "text": "Show me your stall.",
              "action": "trade"
            },
            {
              "text": "Just looking."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hello",
          "text": "Back again, ranger? The canopy treating you well?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Tune my suit.",
              "action": "upgrades"
            },
            {
              "text": "Show me the armor.",
              "action": "wardrobe"
            },
            {
              "text": "Let's trade.",
              "action": "trade"
            },
            {
              "text": "Can I build a hover car?",
              "next": "fabricator"
            },
            {
              "text": "I saw a Brood carrier. Can you build me a fighter?",
              "requires": "carrier_seen",
              "unless": "kestrel_blueprint",
              "next": "carrier_blueprint"
            },
            {
              "text": "I salvaged a relic.",
              "requires": "salvaged",
              "unless": "maro_salvage",
              "sets": "maro_salvage",
              "next": "salvage"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rotor cores keep vanishing. Know anything?",
              "requires": "met_maro",
              "unless": "foundry_started",
              "sets": "foundry_started",
              "next": "foundry_brief"
            },
            {
              "text": "About the foundry ledger.",
              "requires": "foundry_started",
              "unless": "foundry_exposed",
              "next": "foundry_case_status"
            },
            {
              "text": "Any spare scrap for a beginner?",
              "unless": "maro_gift",
              "sets": "maro_gift",
              "scrap": 25,
              "next": "gift"
            },
            {
              "text": "Later, Maro."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "upgrades_intro",
          "text": "Bigger fuel cells, faster servos, a longer grapple line. Every part you pry off the old relics is worth something to me. Scrap pays for the rest.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Let's see the upgrades.",
              "action": "upgrades"
            },
            {
              "text": "Where do parts come from?",
              "next": "parts"
            },
            {
              "text": "Maybe later."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "parts",
          "text": "Relics. Those glowing caps half buried in the moss. Use bare hands and pry one loose, and you've got a part. Markets buy them, and my best work needs them.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "armor",
          "text": "Plate from the old shrine foundries. Exo rigs for climbers, hardsuits for the Rootdeep, and a vanguard set I don't sell to just anyone.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Show me.",
              "action": "wardrobe"
            },
            {
              "text": "Something else.",
              "next": "hello"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "salvage",
          "text": "Good hands. Sell parts at any stall, or keep them: the higher upgrade tiers take parts as well as scrap.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "gift",
          "text": "Here, twenty-five scrap. Pay me back by not falling off a bridge.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "fabricator",
          "sets": "heard_fabricator",
          "text": "The fabricator by the garage, near where you woke, takes lumen shards, rotor cores and Hive alloy. Two rotor cores and a handful of lumen gets you a Skimmer: fans, wing, the lot.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Where are rotor cores?",
              "next": "rotors"
            },
            {
              "text": "Thanks.",
              "next": "hello"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "carrier_blueprint",
          "sets": "kestrel_blueprint",
          "text": "A Brood carrier? Then the old flight plans are true. I'll leave a Kestrel blueprint at the frontier fabricator. Bring Hive alloy, rotor cores, lumen and scrap; we'll put a fighter in the sky.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "rotors",
          "text": "Up high. Tower roofs, shrine steps. And the Hive hoards them by its spires. Bring a weapon if you go looking there.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "foundry_brief",
          "text": "Rotor cores are walking out of the yards, and somebody is signing for them. Trace the shipments through three checkpoints in the machine works and rail yards, and find the steward who sells sap and alloy to the brood.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "foundry_reminder",
          "text": "Three checkpoints in the machine works and the rail yards. The steward keeps a ledger for the Hive; find it and bring it into the open.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "foundry_case_status",
          "text": "The three manifest pages will tie the foundry shipments to the Hive. What do you need?",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Remind me of the checkpoints.",
              "unless": "foundry_pages_complete",
              "next": "foundry_reminder"
            },
            {
              "text": "I have all three manifest pages.",
              "requires": "foundry_pages_complete",
              "unless": "foundry_exposed",
              "sets": "foundry_exposed",
              "next": "foundry_exposure"
            },
            {
              "text": "Back.",
              "next": "hello"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "foundry_exposure",
          "text": "The pages trace rotor cores, sap and alloy from the yards to the brood. The steward's seal is on every shipment. I'll take the ledger to the civic registry and open the yard back to its workers.",
          "next": "hello"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keeper_1",
      "speaker": "ines",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "first",
          "unless": "met_ines"
        },
        {
          "node": "hello"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "first",
          "sets": "met_ines",
          "text": "Careful by the rail; the wind off the crown gets strong up here. I'm Ines. I broker sap contracts and sell kits to anyone wiring the north span.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Let's trade.",
              "action": "trade"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sap contracts?",
              "next": "sap"
            },
            {
              "text": "What are the Arbors, really?",
              "next": "arbors"
            },
            {
              "text": "Goodbye."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hello",
          "text": "Ranger. The sap runs strong today.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Let's trade.",
              "action": "trade"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tell me about sap again.",
              "next": "sap"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tavi marked a Hive spire. What is the stain doing?",
              "requires": "tavi_scouted",
              "unless": "ines_sap_warned",
              "next": "hive_sap"
            },
            {
              "text": "What are the Arbors, really?",
              "next": "arbors"
            },
            {
              "text": "I built a bridge.",
              "requires": "bridge_built",
              "unless": "ines_bridge",
              "sets": "ines_bridge",
              "next": "bridge"
            },
            {
              "text": "Like my hover car?",
              "requires": "fabricated",
              "unless": "ines_car",
              "sets": "ines_car",
              "next": "car"
            },
            {
              "text": "Anything strange at the bridges after dark?",
              "requires": "met_ines",
              "unless": "windsor_started",
              "sets": "windsor_started",
              "next": "windsor_brief"
            },
            {
              "text": "Remind me about the Windsor gate.",
              "requires": "windsor_started",
              "unless": "windsor_exposed",
              "next": "windsor_reminder"
            },
            {
              "text": "Goodbye."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sap",
          "text": "Every Arbor pulls water half a kilometer up its trunk and concentrates the heavy water in it. Tap a trunk and it will power your machines, as long as you don't ask more than the tree can give.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "hive_sap",
          "sets": "ines_sap_warned",
          "text": "That purple stain drinks the Arbors' heavy-water sap. The Hive is starving its roots to feed those carriers. Don't tap a corrupted trunk; help me keep the clean groves alive.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "arbors",
          "text": "Engineers rewrote them generations ago. They gave the forest a job, and the forest gave us a city. Treat them as partners, ranger, not pumps.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "bridge",
          "text": "I saw. Traffic took to it within the hour. The city grows where you lead it.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "car",
          "text": "Four ducts and a wedge of paint. Keep it off the bridge decks at rush hour, and keep it out of the Arbors' branches.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "windsor_brief",
          "text": "The Windsor toll gates open after dark with nobody on the log. Watch the two bridges at night. Someone in the civic hall is letting the Brood carriers cross.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "windsor_reminder",
          "text": "Night watch on the Windsor bridges first, then the Gothic civic hall. The gate logs will name the councillor.",
          "next": "hello"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keeper_2",
      "speaker": "tavi",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "first",
          "unless": "met_tavi"
        },
        {
          "node": "hello"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "first",
          "sets": "met_tavi",
          "text": "Shh. Listen. Hear that hum under the wind? That's the Rootdeep. I'm Tavi. I map the shrines down there and sell whatever I can't carry.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Shrines?",
              "next": "shrines"
            },
            {
              "text": "What's the hum?",
              "next": "hum"
            },
            {
              "text": "Let's trade.",
              "action": "trade"
            },
            {
              "text": "Goodbye."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hello",
          "text": "Still in one piece? Good. The roots ate two of my maps this week.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Let's trade.",
              "action": "trade"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tell me about the shrines.",
              "next": "shrines"
            },
            {
              "text": "What's the hum?",
              "next": "hum"
            },
            {
              "text": "What are the black spires?",
              "requires": "heard_hum",
              "next": "nests"
            },
            {
              "text": "I brought down a Hive nest.",
              "requires": "nest_destroyed",
              "unless": "tavi_nest",
              "sets": "tavi_nest",
              "scrap": 40,
              "next": "nest_reward"
            },
            {
              "text": "The stain is spreading. Mark me a spire to scout.",
              "requires": "corruption_seen",
              "unless": "tavi_scouted",
              "next": "scout_mark"
            },
            {
              "text": "I opened a shrine.",
              "requires": "shrine_complete",
              "unless": "tavi_reward",
              "sets": "tavi_reward",
              "scrap": 30,
              "next": "reward"
            },
            {
              "text": "Those Rootdeep tracks. Where do they lead?",
              "requires": "met_tavi",
              "unless": "bile_started",
              "sets": "bile_started",
              "next": "bile_brief"
            },
            {
              "text": "Remind me about Belle Isle.",
              "requires": "bile_started",
              "unless": "bile_exposed",
              "next": "bile_reminder"
            },
            {
              "text": "Goodbye."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "shrines",
          "text": "The first engineers sealed seed vaults behind machine puzzles. Weight plates, latches, doors. Solve one and the vault opens. Bring a crate and patience.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "hum",
          "sets": "heard_hum",
          "text": "Old machines waking up. Most are friendly. But last week I found claw marks on a vault door. Big ones. Metal ones.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "The Hive?",
              "next": "hive"
            },
            {
              "text": "I'll keep my eyes open.",
              "next": "hello"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hive",
          "sets": "asked_hive",
          "text": "Don't say that name so loud. The Siblings beat the Hive a thousand years ago. Stories, mostly. Mostly.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "reward",
          "text": "You did? Then the vaults still remember us. Here, a scout's cut: thirty scrap. Tell me everything you saw down there.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "nests",
          "sets": "heard_nests",
          "text": "Nests. Out past the grove, three of them, humming. Drones circle them and a heavy sentinel keeps watch. Break the spire and the swarm stops coming.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "nest_reward",
          "text": "You did WHAT? Then it's true: the Hive is back, and it can bleed. Forty scrap, ranger. And watch the sky.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "scout_mark",
          "sets": "tavi_scouted",
          "text": "I'll mark the nearest surface spire on your map. Break it and the local swarm loses its anchor. Don't linger: the stain's edge is moving.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "bile_brief",
          "text": "Belle Isle. Glide across or take a boat. An institute out there trades Dr. Bile's notes with the Hive, and there is a vault under it. Somebody has to get inside.",
          "next": "hello"
        },
        {
          "id": "bile_reminder",
          "text": "Belle Isle: find a way into the vault under the institute, and bring out the notes they trade.",
          "next": "hello"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "walker_0",
      "speaker": "local",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "hi"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "hi",
          "text": "Morning! Mind the lanes. The rovers never brake for anyone."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "walker_1",
      "speaker": "local",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "hi"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "hi",
          "text": "Have you seen the north span at dusk? The whole bridge glows like a branch full of fireflies.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "It's beautiful.",
              "next": "grandmother"
            },
            {
              "text": "I'm in a hurry."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "grandmother",
          "text": "Isn't it? My grandmother helped graft those towers. She said the trees chose where they'd stand."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "walker_2",
      "speaker": "local",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "hi"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "hi",
          "text": "The markets restock at dawn. If you want a gate kit, get to a stall early."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "walker_3",
      "speaker": "local",
      "entries": [
        {
          "node": "hi"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "hi",
          "text": "My cousin says something big is moving under the roots. I say my cousin needs more sleep.",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Something big?",
              "next": "tavi"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probably nothing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "tavi",
          "text": "Ask Tavi at the west market. She goes down there. On purpose!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
